{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/145954-gauntlet-disappears-possible-consequences-for-the-world","id":145954,"title":"Gauntlet disappears - Possible consequences for the world?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-22T13:11:44-07:00","id":145954,"title":"Gauntlet disappears - Possible consequences for the world?","content":"What would be the possible (bad) consequences if the Gauntlet would &quot;disappear&quot;? My group is interested in such an alternative setting and now I'm looking for ideas (brainstorming <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1999-wolf","name":"Wolf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1999_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T13:20:52-07:00","id":145970,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure that's covered as one of the &quot;World of Darkness Destroyed&quot; Scenarios in Mirrors. Might want to have a check there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T13:25:18-07:00","id":145973,"title":"","content":"Like, an alternative setting in which the gauntlet never existed? Or one in which it did, but was somehow destroyed? The former would probably look a lot like Pangea, (and I do think a Pangea game could be a lot of fun!). The latter would definitely have some pretty big consequences. For one thing the Azlu would probably be in a hell of a panic, maybe even willing to ally with the Uratha to try to find a way to restore it. There would be sprits all over the place, obviously. A lot of it is difficult to speculate on, because it's a pretty fundamental assumption of the universe to break.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T14:44:42-07:00","id":146055,"title":"","content":"Look at the two origin episodes from Season 2 of Legend of of Korra for my idea of what it would be like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T14:58:35-07:00","id":146063,"title":"","content":"I once ran a short game that started in a post apocaliptic future were the gaunlet was destroyed. Most of humanity was ensalved or possesed by spirits. the azlu were working with the werewolfs and remaining free humans, making and tending for the walls that protect them from spirits. got a lot of insipiration from the rotworld storyline from the swampthing and animal.<br /> <br /> It eneded up being a cahalith' dream and the whole point of the chronicle was stopping the apocalypse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2245-quimeradc","name":"Quimeradc","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T15:50:24-07:00","id":146100,"title":"","content":"Should really look at the lodge of last winter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T17:54:20-07:00","id":146223,"title":"","content":"We narrowly avoided something like that in our werewolf game, though I think it would have been cool (if horrifying).<br /> <br /> People would be in awful position, and would need help to survive, odds are the packs wouldn't be able to manage to protect them all as elements and concepts and fears incarnate popped into existence and started wrecking folks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T18:33:40-07:00","id":146237,"title":"","content":"It really results in a hell on earth scenario for humans, they would quickly find themselves much further down the food chain than they already are, I wouldn't be surprised to see society break down into a city-state system for the survivors. The Pure would also probably learn quite quickly why you should be careful what you wish for, it would also most likely result in a major change in how they and the Forsaken interact on a regular basis, I see their relationships becoming much less antagonistic (but never openly friendly by human or werewolf standards.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T18:56:10-07:00","id":146246,"title":"","content":"Well the breakdown of governments would surely happen and there would be militaries with no nation to command them. If they don't fall apart I could see powerful spirits of war getting hold of them. They could turn into pseudo-barbarian tribes sacking the cities of whatever society is left.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1303-zap-rowsdower","name":"zap rowsdower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1303_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}